            <ArticleTitle>Surgical ostioplasty for isolated left main stenosis.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>1562-3</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Left main ostioplasty has been used as an alternative approach to surgical management of patients with isolated left main stenosis without significant calcification. We describe our technique of posterior patch augmentation of the left main ostium.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
